msgstr "gantt\n    title Planning de développement\n    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n    axisFormat %d/%m\n    section Conception\n    Exigences :done, req, 2026-01-06, 5d\n    Conception générale :active, design, after req, 7d\n    section Implémentation\n    Implémentation :impl, after design, 10d"

